                                                                          │                      never deletes the source                                    │  
                                                                          ├─ Finding ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤  
                                                                          │  Finding            DNS goes through the Windows host                           │  
                                                                          │  Severity           Notice                                                      │  
                                                                          │  Origin             documented behaviour                                        │  
                                                                          │  Scope              changed inside this distribution, and applied only after    │  
                                                                          │                      WSL restarts it                                             │  
                                                                          │  Evidence           /etc/resolv.conf lists 10.255.255.254; the file says WSL    │  
                                                                          │                      generated it                                                │  
                                                                          │  Why it matters     WSL writes a resolver that points at the host, so every     │  
                                                                          │                      lookup leaves the distribution and is answered on the       │  
                                                                          │                      Windows side. That is WSL's documented default and it       │  
                                                                          │                      usually works; it is also the reason DNS depends on the     │  
                                                                          │                      host's connection, its VPN and its proxy state, and on a    │  
                                                                          │                      machine whose host resolver is slow every new connection    │  
                                                                          │                      waits                                                       │  
                                                                          │  Benefit            A resolver the distribution manages itself makes lookups    │  
                                                                          │                      independent of the host's resolver -- and of what a VPN     │  
                                                                          │ … and 7 more                                                                     │  
